            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Quick verification task. The paper \"Graph-constrained Reasoning: Faithful Reasoning on Knowledge Graphs with Large Language Models\" (arXiv:2410.13080, ICML 2025) has a disputed author list.\n\nOne source says 6 authors: Luo, Linhao; Zhao, Zicheng; Haffari, Gholamreza; Li, Yuan-Fang; Gong, Chen; Pan, Shirui\nAnother source says 5 authors (no Li, Yuan-Fang): Luo, Linhao; Zhao, Zicheng; Gong, Chen; Haffari, Gholamreza; Pan, Shirui\n\nUse WebSearch to check the arXiv page (arxiv.org/abs/2410.13080) and/or the ICML 2025 / PMLR listing for this paper. Report the exact author list from the authoritative source. Just report the facts - which authors are listed and in what order."
            }
          ],
